=== Andean Parliament ===
Only the three main parties obtained representation in the Andean Parliament, with Union for Peru and the Peruvian Aprista Party obtaining 2 seats (plus 4 substitutes) each, and National Unity getting one seat (and two substitutes). Union for Peru got the most votes, with 24.0% of the valid ballots. Congressman [[Rafael Rey]] of National Unity obtained the most individual votes, with 611,638, after which he announced his own and his party [[National Renewal (Peru)|National Renewal]]'s departure from the coalition.{{cn|date=June 2026}}

